    "That a Hindu people should bind themselves in love and grief to the grandson of the Prophet of Islam is itself a sign: the light of al-Husayn’s sacrifice reached far beyond the Muslim world, for his stand was not for one sect or nation but for all humanity, against tyranny and injustice.",
